    kind: invariant  # ec73
    title: "Undeclared custom field keys land silently: the write path checks only required-present, validate warns only for schema-bearing kinds, CI never runs it --strict, and work_item declares no schema at all"  # ec73
    status: violated  # ec73
    priority: 2  # ec73
    parent:  # ec73
    tags:  # ec73
    - tracker  # ec73
